  "knownGaps": [
    "SuiteCRM field definitions identify property names, types, relations, required state, and live values but do not provide a complete business glossary. The adapter emits structured source-backed roles and does not invent narrative descriptions.",
    "DOM-only benchmark injections are not authoritative application semantics.",
    "A page without a matching successful same-origin GraphQL state response fails closed.",
    "The adapter describes records returned to the current page and fields declared by the current record layout; it does not infer unreturned records or permissions.",
